OL,3,ANvidia shares slide as US tech giant
OL,4,Ainvestigates CEO's affair with
OL,5,Asuspected Chinese spy
OL,6,
OL,7,FShares in US tech giant Nvidia slide
OL,8,Fafter claims CEO Jensen Huang had an
OL,9,Faffair with a suspected Chinese spy
OL,11,FAn early plunge saw the firm's shares
OL,12,Ffall 8%, but they then recovered
OL,13,Fsignificantly to around 4% lower than
OL,14,Ftheir Friday closing price
OL,16,FOn Sunday, the firm - one of the most
OL,17,Fvaluable in the world - opened an
OL,18,Findependent investigation into claims
OL,19,FHuang "had been the target of a foreign
OL,20,Fintelligence effort"
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
