OL,3,ANvidia shares slide as US tech giant
OL,4,Ainvestigates CEO's affair with
OL,5,Asuspected Chinese spy
OL,6,
OL,7,FNvidia says it has no reason to believe
OL,8,Fits secrets or national security were
OL,9,Fcompromised, but will "examine all
OL,10,Favailable information". Huang has
OL,11,Fadmitted to being unfaithful to his
OL,12,Fwife and apologised
OL,14,FDonald Trump says Huang is "a fine
OL,15,Fperson, but you never know what's going
OL,16,Fon", while the Chinese government says
OL,17,Fthe claims are nothing more than a
OL,18,F"smear intended to malign China"
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
PN,31103
SC,0003
