OL,3,ANvidia shares slide as US tech giant
OL,4,Ainvestigates CEO's affair with
OL,5,Asuspected Chinese spy
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe New York Times first reported last
OL,8,Fmonth that Huang had a close
OL,9,Frelationship with Alice Huang, a boss
OL,10,Fat a Singapore-based data centre
OL,11,Fcompany - and that she was suspected of
OL,12,Fgiving information to China
OL,14,FNvidia designs some of the most
OL,15,Fsophisticated AI chips on the planet -
OL,16,Fand since 2022 the US has used various
OL,17,Fexport controls to keep its top tech
OL,18,Fout of China
